WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.490
- So you mentioned you're the
youngest of 10 kids, right?

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:03.750
10.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.583
- Yes.

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:05.559
- Yeah.

00:00:05.559 --> 00:00:07.220
So what, what were your
most random hand-me-downs?

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.710
Cause I was the youngest in my family too.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.032
So I lived off of hand-me-downs.

00:00:10.032 --> 00:00:14.090
- My brother's Sean was the
Gestapo of hand-me-downs.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:18.300
So Damon would give us some
clothes and Sean would take all

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.210
the clothes and would
never get to me until

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:25.370
he outgrew 'em and by that time
I was out growing up myself.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.820
So I always got random hand-me-downs.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.869
I remember one time I
had my father's draws

00:00:29.869 --> 00:00:32.897
and my dad has like a 42 waist.

00:00:32.897 --> 00:00:36.830
And like, it might as well went commando.

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:39.951
Cause it wasn't supporting
anything down there.

00:00:39.951 --> 00:00:42.570
- (laughs) That's just not good.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:44.070
- I had a safety pin on them.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:45.450
It was wind blowing.

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.153
I was flapping all over the place.

00:00:48.623 --> 00:00:50.650
- (laughs) I love you so much.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.330
You're quickly becoming my favorite guest.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:56.290
So wait, which sibling
would be least likely

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:58.370
to answer your call right now?

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:00.760
- It would definitely be Keenan because

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.870
he never picks up his phone.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.010
Keenan don't care about phone calls.

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:06.870
Like he don't care about
phones so much that

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.470
he still has an iPhone one.

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:10.731
I can't FaceTime this man or nothing.

00:01:10.731 --> 00:01:13.070
He's still has a rotary
phone in his pocket

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:14.620
with a very long cord.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:15.453
And Damon.

00:01:15.453 --> 00:01:16.620
Damon won't pick up my call either.

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:18.819
None of them won't pick up my call.

00:01:18.819 --> 00:01:20.977
- Yeah, I don't pick up my phone call.

00:01:20.977 --> 00:01:21.810
(mumurs)

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:22.643
I feel like I'm kind
of the one to, I don't,

00:01:22.643 --> 00:01:25.497
I'm kind of the one too,

00:01:25.497 --> 00:01:29.130
I don't generally answer them
because I'm usually working.

